  "audio.error.queueLoadFailed": "An kasa loda sauti",
  "audio.error.noDownloadableAudio": "Wannan rikodi ba shi da sautin da za a sauke tukuna. Ku sake gwadawa bayan ya gama daidaitawa.",
  "audio.error.notTranscribableLocation": "Ba a adana wannan sauti a wuri da za a rubuta ba.",
  "audio.error.signInToTranscribe": "Ku shiga don rubuta sauti.",
  "audio.consent.whisperLabel": "Whisper (rubuta sauti)",
  "audio.consent.mmsLabel": "MMS (TTS na harsuna da yawa)",
  "audio.consent.whisper.short": "Bayan kun ajiye rikodi, wannan na'ura tana rubuta shi da kanta. Sannan kalmomin da aka faɗa suna haskawa a ƙwayar yayin da rikodin ke kunnawa. Rikodi ba sa barin wannan na'ura.",
  "audio.consent.whisper.learnMore": "Duban rubutun sauti ƙarƙashin ƙwayar yana nuna ko rikodin ya dace da rubutunku, ko ya dan bambanta (za ku iya karɓar abin da aka ji), ko kun gyara bayan naɗawa.\n\n{modifier}+danna kalma a cikin ƙwayar kanta — ba duban rubutun sauti ba — don kunnawa ta tsaya a can. Danna tsirara a ƙwayar har yanzu yana sanya alamar rubutu.\n\nKu kula ko ku cire wannan samfuri daga baya a Zaɓuɓɓuka → Samfurori na gida.",
  "audio.consent.mms.short": "Yana karanta rubutun ƙwayar da ƙara a wannan na'ura a harsuna da yawa. Ba a aika rubutunku zuwa kowace sabar ba.",
  "audio.consent.mms.learnMore": "Ana sauke kowane harshe a lokacin farko da kuka yi amfani da shi. Ku kula ko ku cire wannan samfuri daga baya a Zaɓuɓɓuka → Samfurori na gida.",
