  "audio.aiError.rateLimitedTitle": "Buƙatu sun yi yawa yanzu",
  "audio.aiError.providerUnavailableTitle": "Sabis ɗin AI ba ya samuwa",
  "audio.aiError.providerRejectedTitle": "Mai bayar da AI ya ƙi wannan buƙata",
  "audio.aiError.unknownTitle": "Wani abu ya ɓaci",
  "audio.aiError.dailyLimitBody": "An kai iyakar AI ta yau — tana sake saitawa a tsakar dare UTC. Ku sake gwadawa gobe, ko ku canza wannan aiki zuwa mai bayar da AI na musamman.",
  "audio.aiError.spendCeilingBody": "An dakata AI da ake karɓa har sauran yau — dandalin ya kai iyakar kashewar AI ta yau. Tana sake saitawa a tsakar dare UTC. Babu laifi a aikinku; aikinku bai shafa ba. Don ci gaba yanzu, ku canza wannan aiki zuwa mai bayar da AI na musamman a Saitunan aiki.",
  "audio.aiError.tooLargeBody": "Wannan buƙata ta fi abin da samfurin da aka zaɓa zai iya ɗauka. Ku daftara ƙwayoyi kaɗan a lokaci guda, ku rage adadin misalai a saitunan AI, ko ku zaɓi samfuri mai babban taga na mahalli.",
  "audio.aiError.protectedFormatBody": "Daftarin AI ya canza tsarin da wannan takarda take karewa, don haka an watsar da shi kuma babu abin da aka ajiye. Ku sake daftara ƙwayar, ko ku rubuta fassarar da kanku a kusa da ɓangaren da aka kare. Cikakken bayani na ƙasa yana ambaton ɓangaren fayil da aka kare.",
  "audio.aiError.geminiKeyRequiredBody": "Ku ƙara Gemini API key don amfani da wannan muryar Gemini, ko ku canza layin zuwa Inworld TTS (ana karɓa, babu maɓalli) ko injin MMS na gida.",
  "audio.aiError.geminiFailedBody": "Gemini ya kasa ƙirƙirar wannan layi. Ku duba API key, ko ku canza wannan murya zuwa Inworld TTS.",
  "audio.aiError.translationNotConfiguredBody": "Ku saita mai kammala ga wannan aiki kafin ƙirƙirar murya a ƙwayoyin da ba a fassara ba.",
  "audio.aiError.ttsNotConfiguredBody": "Ku canza wannan aiki zuwa muryar MMS ta gida, wadda take gudana a burauza, ko ku nemi mai gudanarwa ya saita sabis ɗin murya na sabar.",
  "audio.aiError.networkBody": "Ku duba haɗinku kuma ku sake gwadawa. Muryoyin gida suna ci gaba da aiki ba tare da layi ba bayan an sauke samfurinsu.",
  "audio.aiError.audioFormatUnsupportedBody": "Ku gwada loda fayil .wav, .mp3, ko .ogg.",
  "audio.aiError.timedOutBody": "Mai bayar da AI ya ɗauki lokaci da yawa kafin amsa. Ku sake gwadawa — idan ya ci gaba, ku aika ƙaramin buƙata ko ku canza samfuri.",
  "audio.aiError.rateLimitedBody": "Mai bayar da AI yana iyakance buƙatu. Ku jira ɗan lokaci kuma ku sake gwadawa.",
  "audio.aiError.transcriptionModelUnavailableTitle": "Samfurin rubuta sauti ba ya amsawa",
  "audio.aiError.transcriptionModelUnavailableBody": "Ku sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba. Idan ya ci gaba da gazawa, ku zaɓi wani samfuri a Zaɓuɓɓuka → Samfurori na gida → Rubuta sauti, ko ku rubuta sauti a wannan na'ura a maimakon.",
  "audio.aiError.providerUnavailableBody": "Mai bayar da AI ya mayar da kuskuren sabar. Wannan yawanci na ɗan lokaci ne — ku sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba.",
  "audio.aiError.providerRejectedBody": "Buƙatar bai kai samfuri ba. Ku buɗe cikakken bayani na ƙasa kuma ku kwafa shi zuwa taimako idan wannan ya ci gaba.",
  "audio.aiError.unknownBody": "Buƙatar AI ba ta gama ba. Ku buɗe cikakken bayani na ƙasa kuma ku kwafa shi zuwa taimako idan wannan ya ci gaba.",
