  "importExport.sdbh.description": "Ku shigo da UBS MARBLE {dictName}. Ku zaɓi bugun asali (yawanci {masterFile}) a matsayin asali; na zaɓi ku ƙara bugun da aka fassara (misali {localizedFile}) don riga a cika ginshiƙin manufa da fassarar da ta kai. Shigarwa tana kawo fayil ɗaya ga kowace harafin Ibrananci tare da fayil ɗin alamar yankin ma'ana; kowane ma'ana yana rukuni a matsayin sakin layi ɗaya tare da ƙwaya ga ma'ana, jerin bayani, da sharhi.",
