  "importExport.sdbh.notImported.proceed": "Ku shigo ko ta yaya",
  "importExport.biblica.description": "Ku loda fakiti na InDesign (.idml) na Nassin karatu na Biblica. Bayanan karatu kawai ake shigowa — ana tsallake rubutun Nassi, saboda yana fitowa daga fayilolin Nassi da aka buga a maimakon a sake rubuta shi a nan. Kowace bayani tana kiyaye tsarin InDesign da aka kulle, kuma bayanai suna ɗaukar littafi da tazarar babi da suke ciki don su yi daidai da sashe. Jerin da InDesign ke riƙe a sakin layi ɗaya — maganganun ƙetare, ƙamus, jerin abubuwa — koyaushe suna zuwa a matsayin ƙwaya ɗaya ga layi. Na zaɓi, manyan tubalan bayani kuma za a iya raba su zuwa ƙwaya ɗaya ga jumla; fitarwa tana sake haɗa kowane tubali yadda InDesign ya saita shi. Rubutun gaba da na baya na Nassin karatu — abubuwan ciki, “yadda ake amfani”, Ƙamusin Nassi, jadawalai, taswirori, murfi — suma suna shigowa a nan: waɗannan juzu'i ba su da rubutun Nassi, don haka duk rubutunsu ana shigowa, an rukuna ta kanunan su.",
  "importExport.biblica.descriptionTreasureHunt": "Ku loda fakiti na InDesign (.idml) na juzu'in Treasure Hunt Bible. Duk abin da aka saita a kusa da rubutun Nassi ana shigowa — tubalan gaskiya da farauta, gabatarwar littattafai, da rubutun gaba — yayin da ake tsallake rubutun Nassi din kansa, saboda yana fitowa daga fayilolin Nassi da aka buga. Kowace bayani tana kiyaye tsarin InDesign da aka kulle, kuma gaskiya da farauta suna ɗaukar littafi da babi da suke ciki. Jerin da InDesign ke riƙe a sakin layi ɗaya — matakan farauta, ɗigo na gaskiya, shigar abubuwan ciki — koyaushe suna zuwa a matsayin ƙwaya ɗaya ga layi. Na zaɓi, manyan tubaloli kuma za a iya raba su zuwa ƙwaya ɗaya ga jumla; fitarwa tana sake haɗa kowane tubali yadda InDesign ya saita shi.",
  "importExport.biblica.descriptionReach4Life": "Ku loda fakiti na InDesign (.idml) na sashe ko juzu'in Nassi na Reach 4 Life. Littafin aiki da ke kusa da rubutun Nassi ana shigowa — darussa da tafiye-tafiye, batutuwa masu zafi, gabatarwar littattafai, da rubutun gaba da na baya — yayin da ake tsallake rubutun Nassi mai ci gaba, saboda yana fitowa daga fayilolin Nassi da aka buga. Ayoyin da aka nakalta a cikin darasi suna zama tare da darasin. Kowace ƙwaya tana kiyaye tsarin InDesign da aka kulle kuma tana ɗaukar sashen da take ciki. Jerin da InDesign ke riƙe a sakin layi ɗaya — shigar abubuwan ciki, matakan tafiya, shawarar ɗigo — koyaushe suna zuwa a matsayin ƙwaya ɗaya ga layi. Na zaɓi, dogayen sakin layi kuma za a iya raba su zuwa ƙwaya ɗaya ga jumla; fitarwa tana sake haɗa kowanne yadda InDesign ya saita shi.",
  "importExport.biblica.descriptionEbl": "Ku loda fakiti na InDesign (.idml) na jagorar mai gudanarwa ko mai shiga na Equipping Biblical Leaders. Kowace sakin layi mai rubutu ana shigowa — jagorar rubutu ce a duk faɗinta a maimakon Nassi mai bayanai a kusa da shi — kuma kowace ƙwaya tana kiyaye tsarin InDesign da aka kulle. Kanunan jagorar suna zama sassan fayil, don haka mai kewaya yana motsawa batu ko darasi a lokaci. Jerin da InDesign ke riƙe a sakin layi ɗaya — manufofi, kayayyaki, shigar abubuwan ciki — koyaushe suna zuwa a matsayin ƙwaya ɗaya ga layi. Na zaɓi, dogayen sakin layi kuma za a iya raba su zuwa ƙwaya ɗaya ga jumla; fitarwa tana sake haɗa kowanne yadda InDesign ya saita shi.",
  "importExport.biblica.chooseFile": "Ku zaɓi fayil ɗin IDML na Nassin karatu",
  "importExport.biblica.chooseFileTreasureHunt": "Ku zaɓi fayil ɗin IDML na Treasure Hunt",
  "importExport.biblica.chooseFileReach4Life": "Ku zaɓi fayil ɗin IDML na Reach 4 Life",
  "importExport.biblica.chooseFileEbl": "Ku zaɓi fayil ɗin IDML na EBL",
  "importExport.biblica.editionQuestion": "Wane take na Biblica ne wannan?",
  "importExport.biblica.editionQuestionHint": "Kowane take yana amfani da samfurin InDesign nasa, kuma babu abin da ke cikin fakiti da ke faɗin wanne ne. Ku zaɓi ɗaya a mafi yawa. Ku bar duka uku ba a zaɓa ba don karanta fakiti a matsayin bayanan Nassin karatu na Biblica.",
  "importExport.biblica.treasureHuntLabel": "Wannan fayil ne na Treasure Hunt Bible",
  "importExport.biblica.treasureHuntHint": "Treasure Hunt Bible yana amfani da wani samfurin InDesign. Ku zaɓi wannan don shigo da gaskiyarsa, farautarsa, gabatarwar littattafai da rubutun gaba a maimakon neman bayanan karatu.",
  "importExport.biblica.reach4lifeLabel": "Wannan fayil ne na Reach 4 Life",
  "importExport.biblica.reach4lifeHint": "Reach 4 Life yana amfani da samfurin InDesign na uku. Ku zaɓi wannan don shigo da darussansa, tafiye-tafiyensa, batutuwa masu zafi, gabatarwar littattafai da rubutun gaba a maimakon neman bayanan karatu.",
  "importExport.biblica.eblLabel": "Wannan fayil ne na EBL",
  "importExport.biblica.eblHint": "Jagororin Equipping Biblical Leaders suna amfani da samfurin InDesign na huɗu. Ku zaɓi wannan don shigo da dukan jagora, an raba ta sassa ta kanunan batunsa da darasinsa, a maimakon neman bayanan karatu.",
  "importExport.biblica.splitSentencesLabel": "Ku raba dogayen bayanai zuwa ƙwaya ɗaya ga jumla",
  "importExport.biblica.splitSentencesHint": "Ku bar ba a zaɓa ba don shigo da kowane layin bayani a matsayin ƙwaya mafi girma. Jerin har yanzu suna rarrabuwa ta layi ko ta yaya.",
  "importExport.biblica.readingPackage": "Ana karanta fakiti na InDesign…",
  "importExport.biblica.readingPackageWithProgress": "Ana karanta fakiti na InDesign… ({completed} / {total})",
  "importExport.biblica.paragraphsSkipped": {"forms":{"one":"An tsallake sakin layi na Nassi {count}.","other":"An tsallake sakin layukan Nassi {count}."},"countVar":"count"},
  "importExport.bibleSwap.legend": "Musayar Nassi (na zaɓi)",
  "importExport.bibleSwap.intro": "Fitarwar zagaye tana saka bayanan da kuka fassara a cikin IDML na Biblica na asali. Na zaɓi ku ƙara fayil ɗin Nassi da aka fassara don kuma musanya rubutun ayar Turanci da Nassi da ya dace, don bayanai da rubutun Nassi su fito a fayil ɗaya. Ku bar yanayi a bayanai kawai don fitar da bayanai kawai.",
