  "importExport.status.buildingArchive": "Ana gina ajiya…",
  "importExport.format.audioByCharacter.label": "Sauti ta hali",
  "importExport.format.audioByCharacter.description": "WAV ɗaya ga kowane hali, tare da kowane ɗauka a wurinsa a jadawalin lokaci da shiru a tsakani. Duk fayiloli suna farawa a 0:00, don haka suna fadowa a DAW sun riga sun daidaita da juna da fim.",
  "importExport.format.audioByLine.label": "Sauti ta layi",
  "importExport.format.audioByLine.description": "Fayil ɗaya ga kowane naɗa, an lamba ta tsarin kunnawa kuma an suna ta hali. Kowace WAV tana ɗaukar tambarin lokacin watsa da DAW zai iya sanyawa, kuma manifest.csv yana jera kowane fayil tare da lambar lokacinsa. Don bita da sake naɗa layuka ɗaya-ɗaya.",
  "importExport.format.audioChapter.label": "Sautin babi",
  "importExport.format.audioChapter.description": "WAV mai ci gaba ɗaya ga kowane babi, tare da naɗin ayoyi da aka haɗa ƙarshen zuwa ƙarshen ta tsarin aya. Don duba na al'umma — ku kunna babi kai tsaye a wajen edita.",
  "importExport.dialog.audioChapterModeLabel": "Ta babi",
