  "projectSettings.audioMedia.strategyStreamName": "Raf",
  "projectSettings.audioMedia.strategyStreamDescription": "Ku kunna daga hanyar sadarwa. Babu ajiya a wannan na'ura, babu zanen sauti sai kun zaɓa.",
