  "terminology.livingMemory.title": "Ƙwaƙwalwa mai rai",
  "terminology.livingMemory.introText": "Murya da ka'idodin tawagarku da aka rubuta — mahallin aiki da AI take ɗauka ga kowane sabon daftari. Yana girma da kowace tabbatarwa, gyara, da umarni da tawagarku ta ƙara.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.loadingValidatedTranslations": "Ana loda fassarorin da aka tabbatar",
  "terminology.livingMemory.noValidatedTranslationsAria": "Babu fassarorin da aka tabbatar",
  "terminology.livingMemory.noValidatedTranslationsTitle": "Babu fassarorin da aka tabbatar tukuna",
  "terminology.livingMemory.noValidatedTranslationsDescription": "Idan masu fassara da masu bita suka kai iyakar tabbatarwa da ake buƙata a ƙwaya, wannan nau'in asali → manufa yana bayyana a nan. AI tana ɗaukar waɗannan nau'i-nau'i a kowane daftari na gaba.",
