  "terminology.livingMemory.instructionsTitle": "Umarni",
  "terminology.livingMemory.instructionsDescription": "Ku faɗa wa AI abin da wannan aiki yake game da shi — masu sauraro, sauti, ladabi, kulawa ta musamman. Waɗannan suna bayyana a kowane umarnin daftari.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.instructionsPlaceholder": "Babu umarni tukuna.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.instructionsExample": "\"Ku fassara zuwa Swahili na ladabi ga masu karatu manya. Ku guji kalmomin addini sai dai idan asali ya yi amfani da su.\"",
  "terminology.livingMemory.standardsTitle": "Ka'idodi",
  "terminology.livingMemory.standardsDescription": "Ƙa'idodin inganci na duk aiki da AI take duba daftarorinta da su. Ku kama shawarwarin da tawagarku ke komawa gare su.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.standardsPlaceholder": "Babu ka'idodi tukuna.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.standardsExample": "\"Koyaushe ku kiyaye sunayen musamman ba a fassara ba. Lambobi a asali dole ne su bayyana a matsayin lambobi a manufa.\"",
  "terminology.livingMemory.recentExamplesTitle": "Misalan kwanan nan",
  "terminology.livingMemory.recentExamplesDescription": "Nau'i-nau'in asali→manufa da mutum ya tabbatar da AI take amfani da su a matsayin misalan mahalli. Waɗannan su ne fassarorin da tawagarku ta amince.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.brief.title": "Taƙaitaccen",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.brief.description": "Na zaɓi — waɗanda wannan fassara take don su da abin da dole ne ta cimma. AI tana karanta shi a matsayin mahalli, ba a matsayin umarninta ba.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.brief.statusNone": "Ba a fara ba",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.brief.statusDraft": "Daftari",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.brief.statusComplete": "An gama",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.brief.statusNoneExplainer": "Na zaɓi don fassara da hannu. Autopilot ba zai fara ba har sai an amsa aƙalla tambaya ɗaya.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.brief.statusDraftExplainer": "Ya riga yana aiki — AI tana daftara daga kowace amsa da aka ajiye a nan, kuma wannan taƙaitaccen yana cika duban farawar Autopilot. “Daftari” yana nufin wasu tambayoyi ba a amsa ba ko taƙaitaccen ya gabaci gyaranku na ƙarshe; babu abin amincewa.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.brief.statusCompleteExplainer": "An amsa kowace tambaya kuma taƙaitaccen ya dace da gyaranku na ƙarshe. AI tana daftara daga wannan taƙaitaccen.",
  "terminology.livingMemory.section.instructions.description": "Yadda AI ya kamata ta yi hali lokacin daftara, da umarnin hasashe na al'ada",
