  "harmonizer.flagLabel": "Mai daidaitawa",
  "harmonizer.flagDescription": "Ku duba yadda ƙwayoyi suke dacewa a matsayin rubutu, farawa da maganganun da ke buɗewa a aya ɗaya kuma ba su rufewa ba. Shawarwari suna bayyana a gefen gyare-gyare masu wayo, don haka gyare-gyare masu wayo dole ne su kasance kunne ma.",
