  "bibleData.experiment.label": "Ƙarin bayanan Nassi",
  "bibleData.experiment.description": "Yana nuna bayanan Nassi yayin da littafin Nassi ke buɗe: wa ke magana da wa, wanene, mahallin harshen asali, taimakon fassara da duba bayanan Nassi. A wannan na'ura kawai.",
  "bibleData.card.title": "Bayanan Nassi",
  "bibleData.card.enableLabel": "Ku kunna bayanan Nassi",
  "bibleData.card.description": "Bayanan nuni na Nassi daga bibletranslation.org, an gina su daga Macula, OpenText, ACAI da unfoldingWord. Suna ƙarfafa Verse Resources, binciken Nassi, duba Nassi na wakili da ƙarin da ke ƙasa.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.voices.label": "Muryoyi",
  "bibleData.enrichment.voices.description": "Yana nuna wa ke magana da wa a kowane ƙwaya, tare da layukan da ke nuna inda magana ke buɗewa da rufewa.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.whosWho.label": "Wanene",
  "bibleData.enrichment.whosWho.description": "Yana bin kowane mutum a cikin sashe, har da wakilan da batutuwa da ba a faɗi ba da ke nufin su.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.structure.label": "Tsarin sashe",
  "bibleData.enrichment.structure.description": "Yana nuna taken sassa, alamun tambaya da umarni, da ayoyin da wasu rubutun hannu suka bar.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.originalContext.label": "Mahallin harshen asali",
  "bibleData.enrichment.originalContext.description": "Yana ƙara shafin Mahalli da kalmomin Girkanci ko Ibrananci, fassararsu ta gajere, da wanda kowane wakili ke nufi.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.helps.label": "Taimakon fassara",
  "bibleData.enrichment.helps.description": "Yana nuna Translation Notes da Translation Questions a gefen kalmomi da ayoyin da suke tattaunawa.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.terms.label": "Muhimman kalmomi",
  "bibleData.enrichment.terms.description": "Yana yin alama ga muhimman kalmomi a rubutun asali kuma yana haɗa kowace da maƙalar Translation Words.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.places.label": "Wurare da taswirori",
  "bibleData.enrichment.places.description": "Yana nuna gajeren bayani da taswira ga kowane wuri da sashe ya ambata.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.checks.label": "Duba bayanan Nassi",
  "bibleData.enrichment.checks.description": "Yana duba fassarori da sanannun gaskiya, kamar wa ke magana da inda magana ke ƙarewa.",
  "bibleData.enrichment.autopilot.label": "Autopilot yana amfani da bayanan Nassi",
  "bibleData.enrichment.autopilot.description": "Yana ba wa Autopilot waɗannan gaskiya yayin daftari, kuma yana duba daftarorinsa da su.",
